      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/damiensmith420/meadow-os/tarball/V3.0.0",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/damiensmith420/meadow-os/zipball/V3.0.0",
      "body": "The biggest update yet, adding a full fake internet browser and six hand-coded fictional websites to browse \u2014 all still pure vanilla JS, zero dependencies, zero frameworks.\r\n\r\nWhat's new:\r\n\r\nMeadowExplorer Browser\r\n\r\nA retro IE-style browser window with a full toolbar \u2014 back, forward, refresh, and home buttons with a working history stack\r\nAddress bar supporting .mow domain routing\r\nFavourites bar with one-click shortcuts to all six sites\r\nAnimated loading bar, status bar, and a friendly 404 page for unknown addresses\r\nThe .mow Internet \u2014 6 built-in websites:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Grass Knoll (grassknoll.mow) \u2014 Parody search engine that returns confidently wrong results for anything you type, with suggested searches and a \"People also ask\" section\r\n\ud83d\udc26 NotABird (notabird.mow) \u2014 Parody social media with a full dark-mode timeline, absurd posts from users like @WormMagnate and @fog_investigator, trending topics, and a \"Who to follow\" panel\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 MeadowPedia (meadowpedia.mow) \u2014 Fake encyclopedia with nine full articles including Birds (Government Drones), The Great Worm War of 2003, The Invisible Sandwich, Shadow Sentience, and Soup\r\n\ud83d\udc38 FrogTube (frogtube.mow) \u2014 Parody video platform with a full video grid; clicking any video opens a player where the \"video\" is a bouncing DVD logo, complete with fake comments, progress bar, and an Up Next sidebar\r\n\ud83d\uded2 The Shoppe (shoppe.mow) \u2014 Fake e-commerce store selling things that shouldn't exist (A Jar of Ambient Noise, Pre-Tangled Headphones (Mystery Length), 2019 Vintage Air, and more) with full product pages, customer reviews, and a working cart\r\n\ud83d\udcf0 Doomscroll (doomscroll.mow) \u2014 Parody Reddit/news feed; posts escalate from mildly weird to fully unhinged, expandable comments on every post, and infinite scroll that just keeps going\r\nAlso in this release:\r\n\r\nREADME fully updated with a Built-in Apps table, MeadowExplorer section, and the full .mow site listing\r\nMeadowExplorer icon added to the desktop and Start Menu"
    },
