      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/damiensmith420/meadow-os/zipball/V2.0.0",
      "body": "The first major version bump, introducing a full games collection built entirely with the HTML5 Canvas API \u2014 no libraries, no assets, just code.\r\n\r\nWhat's new:\r\n\r\nClassic Games folder \u2014 a new desktop app that opens an explorer-style window housing all three games and a disclaimer shortcut\r\nSnake \u2014 the original built-in game, now living inside the Classic Games folder\r\nBreakout \u2014 paddle and ball brick-breaker with randomised brick layouts and patterns each round, 2-hit bricks from round 3, and difficulty scaling per level\r\nFrog Crossing \u2014 lane-crossing game (inspired by Frogger) with traffic lanes, river logs and lily pads, random lane speeds per level, and 5 home bays to fill\r\nIP Disclaimer \u2014 data/classic-games/DISCLAIMER.txt and a full intellectual property notice added to the README, crediting Nokia, Atari, and Konami as original rights holders for the mechanics these games draw inspiration from\r\nAll game visuals are drawn programmatically \u2014 no sprites, no external assets."
    },
