      "body": "The first public release of Meadow OS \u2014 a retro Windows-inspired desktop UI for browsing and downloading my projects, running entirely in the browser with no frameworks and no build step.\r\n\r\nIncludes:\r\n\r\nDraggable, resizable, minimizable windows with a taskbar\r\nDownloads browser pulling live release data from the GitHub API (cached via GitHub Actions)\r\nBuilt-in Terminal with help, ls, cat, download, and more\r\nAbout Me notepad rendering about.md as Markdown\r\nRecycle Bin, Display Properties, and a multi-theme system\r\nMobile layout that auto-activates on small screens\r\nBuilt-in Snake game\r\nHosted free on GitHub Pages \u2014 pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JS"
